Third-party data in harness

models.dev pricing data
  crates/harness-usage/data/pricing-snapshot.json is a trimmed copy of the model prices published
  at https://models.dev (https://github.com/sst/models.dev), refreshed on the date it records. Only
  the providers harness supports, and for each model its input, output, cache read and cache write
  prices, are kept. `harness pricing update` fetches the same data again, only when you run it.

